      "OriginalText": "Monday morning!",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 1,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 5.1,
      "EndSecond": 10.2,
      "OriginalText": "Jolted out of my bed this morning in a clammy sweat",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 2,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 10.3,
      "EndSecond": 15.7,
      "OriginalText": "Devoured my cornflakes the very next thing",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 3,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 17.5,
      "EndSecond": 22.2,
      "OriginalText": "My symptoms worsen each day I spend in here",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 4,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 22.3,
      "EndSecond": 29,
      "OriginalText": "Welcome to my mite-filled paradisus, my sweet home",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 5,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 29.1,
      "EndSecond": 32.2,
      "OriginalText": "Just pull yourselves together",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 6,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 32.3,
      "EndSecond": 35,
      "OriginalText": "And give your gushing speech",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 7,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 35.1,
      "EndSecond": 45.5,
      "OriginalText": "If you want a wake-up call, I'll gladly dump\nthe booze over all your heads right now",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 8,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 46.3,
      "EndSecond": 49.3,
      "OriginalText": "Just so you know, you're the ones who've been leaving me behind",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 9,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 49.4,
      "EndSecond": 52.3,
      "OriginalText": "And I've come all this way whether I like it or not",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 10,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 52.4,
      "EndSecond": 55.7,
      "OriginalText": "Nothing ever comes true in this whole damn world",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 11,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 55.8,
      "EndSecond": 58.4,
      "OriginalText": "Blisters keep on bleeding out",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 12,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 58.5,
      "EndSecond": 58.7,
      "OriginalText": "(Faraway)",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 13,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 58.8,
      "EndSecond": 60.1,
      "OriginalText": "(Faraway)\nCause at some point we slipped into Arcadia",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 14,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 60.2,
      "EndSecond": 61.6,
      "OriginalText": "Cause at some point we slipped into Arcadia",
